  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">NTA NIFTEE Stage-II Result 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-03T18:09:42+05:30\">June 3, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">6:09 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://exams.nta.nic.in/niftee/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>National Testing Agency (NTA)</strong></a> has released the <strong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"241\">Stage-II Result</strong>&nbsp;for the <strong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"313\">National Institute of Fashion Technology Entrance Exam 2026</strong> on its official website. The <strong>Stage-II exam</strong> was conducted on <strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"385\">26 April 2026</strong>, and the last date to submit the application form was <strong data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"460\">18 December 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"499\">Stage-II Result</strong>&nbsp;using their <strong data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"572\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">NTA NIFTEE Stage-II Result 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">NTA NIFTEE Examination 2026 : Short Details </h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/nta-niftee-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>08 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>16 January 2026 (with no late fee)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Late Fee Payment : <strong>19 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>20-21 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong> 08 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details :<strong> 29 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>04 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>17 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared Date : <strong>20 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Final Answer Key : <strong>23 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Stage-II Exam Date :<strong> 26 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Stage-II Exam City Details : <strong>18 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Stage-II Admit Card : <strong>22 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Stage-II Result Declared Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>03 June 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>NTA </b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>Gen / OBC / EWS</strong> <strong>(Single Programme)</strong> <strong>: ₹ 2000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>Gen / OBC / EWS (For Two Programme)</strong> <strong>: ₹ 3000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC / ST / PH</strong> <strong>(Single Programme)</strong> <strong>: ₹ 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC / ST / PH (For Two Programme)</strong> <strong>: ₹ 750/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">NTA NIFTEE Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On 01 August 2026</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>N/A</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>24 Years (<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">For B.Des &amp; B.F.Tech</span>)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">M.Des, M.F.M, M.F.Tech&nbsp;<strong>: No Age Limit</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>NTA </b>provides age relaxation for the <strong>All India Sainik School Admission (AISSEE)</strong> Admission as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">NTA NIFTEE Online Form 2026 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.748%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Course Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.252%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.748%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bachelor of Design (B.Des)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.252%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"129\">Class 12th from any recognized board</strong>, including <strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"149\">NIOS</strong>, or must hold a <strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"217\">3–4 year diploma or an equivalent qualification</strong> approved by a recognized authority. Applicants must also meet the <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"308\">prescribed age limit</strong>, follow the official guidelines, and be <strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"368\">Indian citizens</strong> to apply.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.748%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bachelor of Fashion Technology (B.F.Tech.)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.252%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"127\">passed Class 12th with Mathematics as a subject</strong>, or they must hold a <strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"211\">3–4 year Engineering Diploma from a recognized institution</strong>. Applicants must also fulfill the required <strong data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"271\">age criteria</strong> and must be <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"305\">citizens of India</strong> to be considered eligible.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.748%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Master of Design (M. Des.)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.252%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"153\">Bachelor’s Degree in any stream from a recognized university</strong>, or they must possess a <strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"213\">3-year Diploma from NIFT or NID</strong>. Applicants should also meet the prescribed <strong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"271\">age limit</strong> and must be <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"305\">citizens of India</strong> to qualify for the application process.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.748%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Master of Fashion Management (M.F.M.)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.252%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"136\">Bachelor’s Degree in any stream from a recognized university</strong>, or a <strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"178\">3-year Diploma from NIFT or NID</strong> to be eligible. Along with the educational qualification, applicants must also fulfill the required <strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"295\">age criteria</strong> and be <strong data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"322\">Indian citizens</strong> as per official guidelines.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.748%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Master of Fashion Technology (M.F.Tech.)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.252%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have completed <strong data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"114\">B.F.Tech from NIFT</strong> or hold a <strong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"191\">B.E./B.Tech degree from a recognized university or institution</strong>. Applicants must also satisfy the <strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"246\">age requirements</strong> and be <strong data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"275\">citizens of India</strong> as per official rules.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.748%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bachelor of Design (B.Des.) For Artisan Category</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.252%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"121\">passed Class 12th from a recognized board</strong>, including <strong data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"141\">NIOS</strong>, or possess a <strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"207\">3–4 year Diploma or an equivalent qualification</strong>. Additionally, applicants must have a <strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"268\">valid Artisan Card</strong>. Along with the educational criteria, candidates must also fulfill the <strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"364\">prescribed age limit</strong> and be <strong data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"393\">citizens of India</strong> as per official guidelines.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check : <a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rcf-kapurthala-apprentice-recruitment-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">RCF Kapurthala Apprentice Recruitment 2025</span></a></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download NTA NIFTEE Stage-II Result 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"10rmkhb\" data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"294\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the official website of the</span><br data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"248\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"292\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">National Testing Agency</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cmeeow\" data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"392\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, click on:</span>\n<ul data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"392\">\n<li data-section-id=\"y6vt6z\" data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"392\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"385\">“NIFT Entrance Exam Stage-II Result 2026”</strong> link</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1lpj2cr\" data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"480\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your login details:</span>\n<ul data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"480\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1catb75\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"448\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Application Number</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pynuxs\" data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"480\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Date of Birth / Password</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3pbgme\" data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"515\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on <strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"512\">Submit / Login</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14hj8g8\" data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"575\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your <strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"546\">result</strong>&nbsp;will appear on the screen.</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"v8ppxv\" data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"634\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"617\">Download or note down the details</strong> for reference.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;NTA NIFTEE Online Form 2026 &nbsp;: </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>\n<h3 data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"89\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"87\">UG Programmes : </strong>For <strong data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"103\">B.Des</strong>, candidates must appear in <strong data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"163\">GAT, CAT, and Situation Test</strong>. The weightage is <strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"193\">CAT 50%</strong>, <strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"206\">GAT 30%</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"234\">Situation Test 20%</strong>. For <strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"252\">B.F.Tech</strong>, candidates only need to appear in <strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"295\">GAT</strong>.</span></h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3 data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"326\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"324\">PG Programmes : </strong>For <strong data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"340\">M.Des</strong>, candidates must appear in <strong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"406\">GAT, CAT, and a Personal Interview</strong>. For <strong data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"419\">MFM</strong> and <strong data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"436\">M.F.Tech</strong>, candidates must appear in <strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"496\">GAT and a Personal Interview</strong>.</span></h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3 data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"528\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"526\">Marking Scheme : </strong>Each correct answer earns <strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"565\">1 mark</strong